%% Context: Engineering product decision tree balancing capability, cost, and delivery time.
decisiontree "Buy vs Build Decision"

q "Does a product meet critical requirements?"
  yes: q "Can vendor pass security and compliance review?"
    yes: q "Is total cost within the approved budget?"
      yes: a "Buy and integrate"
      no: a "Negotiate or seek another vendor"
    no: a "Build internally or use a compliant platform"
  no: q "Can the team build a safe MVP before the deadline?"
    yes: q "Is long-term ownership capacity funded?"
      yes: a "Build in-house"
      no: a "Reduce scope or use a managed service"
    no: a "Buy adjacent capability and defer custom features"
